    <div class="stop-header"><span class="stop-num">1.</span> <span class="stop-name self">Palace of Fine Arts</span></div>
    <div class="stop-row">📒 The lone survivor of the 1915 Panama–Pacific International Exposition — Bernard Maybeck's domed Roman rotunda behind a swan-filled lagoon. Recast in concrete in the 1960s, it remains the most photographed structure outside the Bay's bridges.</div>
    <div class="stop-row">📖 <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palace_of_Fine_Arts" target="_blank">Wikipedia</a></div>
    <div class="tour-box">
      <div>🏛️ Open 24/7</div>
      <div>⏰ ~45 min</div>
