  <div class="hotel-first">🏨 FROM HOTEL: 🚶 10 min · 🚕  5 min → San Francisco Chinatown</div>

  <!-- inclusion-bar: editorial — Fodor's, Rick Steves SF, Atlas Obscura, SF Travel — the oldest Chinese enclave in North America, dense historic streetscape -->
  <div class="stop-block">
    <div class="stop-header"><span class="stop-num">1.</span> <span class="stop-name self">San Francisco Chinatown</span></div>
    <div class="stop-row">📒 The oldest and largest Chinese enclave in North America, settled in the 1850s and rebuilt after 1906 with the swooping rooflines and lantern-lit alleys you see today. Wander the Dragon Gate, Portsmouth Square, fortune-cookie alleys, and herbal pharmacies on foot.</div>
    <div class="stop-row">📖 <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinatown,_San_Francisco" target="_blank">Wikipedia</a></div>
    <div class="tour-box">
      <div>🏛️ Open 24/7</div>
