    <div class="stop-row">📒 A working powerhouse — the four giant sheaves that pull the cables under every cable-car line in the city spin in the middle of the floor. Inside the same Mason Street barn: vintage 1870s grip cars, ringing bells, and the easy explanation of why those wood-and-steel cars still climb the hills.</div>
    <div class="stop-row">📖 <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Francisco_Cable_Car_Museum" target="_blank">Wikipedia</a></div>
    <div class="tour-box">
