      <div>🚫 Closed Monday</div>
      <div>⏰ ~1h</div>
      <div class="tour-meet"><div>📍 <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cable+Car+Museum+1201+Mason+St+San+Francisco+CA+94108" target="_blank">1201 Mason St</a></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stop-photos">
      <img src="_build/assets/800px-San_Francisco_Cable_Car_Museum.jpg" alt="Cable Car Museum">
